58044901", "personaname": "TheNameTaker", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198858044901/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 40, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 40, "last_played": 1762550695, "avatar": "a73955f5d746e6e266b5170c2eed3047928ff0b7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Played Stellar Blade and really liked the style of game so thought id check out some dark souls type games. Started up game and the intro lead to a small fight. First thing i noticed was how very very slow my characters responses were. Second thing was that i had to separately control which way my camera was pointing and where my character was looking. AKA couldnt land hits because the character was looking a different way. Got through the short intro tutorial mission, sat through a longer intro story. Got through that and was met with the fact that i couldnt create a character type and build from there but instead had a to pick a preset character with locked stats that evenly get better as you level up. Picked a character that I thought would match my play style. Went into first match crushing easy enemies but confused why i couldnt parry or block with my sword. Quit game and went online to figure out how to block. Turns out your characters are too stupid to use their weapons to block and you have to find and equip left handed weapons or shields to block. I now have zero intention of returning to the game. Made it a whole 40 mins. Maybe there are hidden settings to change things but I couldnt find any. Back to stellar blade I guess", "timestamp_created": 1762551576, "timestamp_updated": 1762551576, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 5, "weighted_vote_score": "0.402162015438079834", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 2}]}, {"recommendationid": "208663766", "author": {"steamid": "76561198044489976", "personaname": "llameerll", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/llameerll/", "num_games_owned": 215, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 53779, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 34641, "last_played": 1783761014, "avatar": "42b57825f6574aaf8b8b04da12bdaac9bad260a9"}, "language": "english", "review": "good", "timestamp_created": 1762551185, "timestamp_updated": 1762551185, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208663358", "author": {"steamid": "76561198136141341", "personaname": "RichardǂRide", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198136141341/", "num_games_owned": 96, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 46330, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 570, "playtime_at_review": 18362, "last_played": 1791119855, "avatar": "60bbdf2afba9a9ee257a29d00de7869fa84ee454"}, "language": "english", "review": "good", "timestamp_created": 1762550828, "timestamp_updated": 1762550828, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208660420", "author": {"steamid": "76561197995316139", "personaname": "Seph", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197995316139/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 27037, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 23256, "last_played": 1769870501, "avatar": "080a6f3d2e2d03b00a8872b44a9a5b5e8871e251"}, "language": "english", "review": "\"The penalty has been waived because a player left early\" Here is your -300 points. \nAlso Everdark Libra needs to be fixed or removed from deep of night. This boss is so bad it's not even funny. \ntl;dr: The deep of night point system is a pharce. If you play with random people you will have streaks of losing hundreds to thousands of points.\n\nThere is a lot of good things in this game but the deep of night mode is currently the only thing that gives you a reason to play once you defeated every boss. And that mode needs some rebalancing. In the higher level only three or four characters are still valid choices. Everything other than Wylder, Ironeye and Duchess or Recluse will either not do enough damage, have no damage windows or a high likely of bad equipment.\nAnd the penalties for loosing are way too harsh. 100 points away from lvl 5 lost like several weeks worth of progress because of factors I couldn't even control. It honestly got me questioning what the point of it all is.\nIt's especially harsh for the amount of luck involved, be it the map layout, item drop rate or the game deciding that it will now show a power point presentation of a boss because there is too much lightning or a bad connection.\nAnd in the end, reaching higher depth levels is almost the only point in that mode, aside from maybe being matched with more experienced players. The other reward, deep relics, can't be used anywhere else.\nIt would be way more fun if you could just freely choose to play any level you unlocked for no depth points and no penalty. The way it is now is just too much stress, not enough fun.", "timestamp_created": 1762548314, "timestamp_updated": 1767811771, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.517050862312316895", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208651359", "author": {"steamid": "76561199427141670", "personaname": "MRjlg24", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199427141670/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 3462, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 189, "last_played": 1771770541, "avatar": "abd9aadee1fd5fccaed87bbc43f88879f1e2e21b"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun quick games!!", "timestamp_created": 1762540594, "timestamp_updated": 1762540594, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208651177", "author": {"steamid": "76561198774686686", "personaname": "usagiiii", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198774686686/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 19884, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 678, "last_played": 1780609991, "avatar": "7d5de8a439cd2932c57d0e6b21c3e96854e17e9d"}, "language": "english", "review": "it nice game bae\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1762540450, "timestamp_updated": 1762540450, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208649306", "author": {"steamid": "76561199540334104", "personaname": "Alpha", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199540334104/", "num_games_owned": 11,